@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
### Set accessToken, workspaceId, materialId and quizId in a private REST-client environment.

### Public registration — 201; duplicate email — 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"StrongStudyPassword!2026"}

### Public sign-in — 200; wrong credentials — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"StrongStudyPassword!2026"}

### Current profile — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a workspace — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Database systems"}

### Paginated workspace list — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces?limit=20&offset=0&search=Database
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read upload processing jobs — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/materials/{{materialId}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Retrieve a quiz without answer keys — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/{{quizId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Overall progress — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid pagination — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
